{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Zendesk API (baton-zendesk connector surface)",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Describes only the Zendesk endpoints baton-zendesk calls. Scope is derived from pkg/client/{client,tickets}.go; request sites that go through the vendored go-zendesk SDK were resolved to their paths in vendor/github.com/nukosuke/go-zendesk/zendesk (accessed 2026-09-21), and response shapes come from that SDK's structs plus the connector's own ticket types. The Zendesk documentation URL for each operation is cited inline in pkg/client and is carried through to `externalDocs` below.\n\nTwo pagination styles coexist, and which one an endpoint uses is load-bearing. Cursor-based pagination (CBP) sends `page[size]` and `page[after]` and reads `meta.has_more`/`meta.after_cursor`; offset-based pagination (OBP) sends `page` and reads a link envelope. `page[size]` is not optional on the dual-mode endpoints: without it Zendesk falls back to OBP, omits `meta` entirely, and the sync stops after page one (pkg/client/client.go:19).\n\nThree of the user-listing calls hand-roll their URL rather than going through the SDK's option encoder, because that encoder emits an empty `query=` parameter which silently disables CBP on those endpoints (tracked as CXH-1907).\n\nTicket create and read use the connector's own Ticket type rather than the SDK's: go-zendesk's CustomField.UnmarshalJSON rejects JSON numbers, so any ticket carrying a numeric custom-field value fails to decode through the vendored typed methods — including values on fields this connector never touches.\n\nTwo drain loops are explicitly bounded and error rather than truncate: ticket forms at 10 pages and ticket fields at 50 pages."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{subdomain}.zendesk.com/api/v2",
      "description": "Zendesk instance, built from the `subdomain` config field. A `base-url` config value takes precedence over this and replaces the whole URL.",
      "variables": {
        "subdomain": {
          "default": "example"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "apiTokenBasic": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "users",
      "description": "Users, including creation, update, and both stages of deletion."
    },
    {
      "name": "groups",
      "description": "Groups and group membership."
    },
    {
      "name": "organizations",
      "description": "Organizations and organization membership."
    },
    {
      "name": "roles",
      "description": "Custom agent roles."
    },
    {
      "name": "tickets",
      "description": "Tickets plus the ticket forms and fields backing the ticketing schema."
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/users.json": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "listUsers",
        "tags": [
          "users"
        ],
        "summary": "List users, optionally filtered by role",
        "description": "Called in two variants against the same path. The team-member sync filters by the built-in `role`; the custom-role grant sync filters by `permission_set`. URL is hand-rolled to keep CBP enabled (CXH-1907).",
        "externalDocs": {
          "url": "https://developer.zendesk.com/api-reference/ticketing/users/users/#list-users"
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "role",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Built-in role filter. Omitted when listing all users.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "end-user",
                "agent",
                "admin"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "permission_set",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Custom role ID. Mutually exclusive with `role` in this connector — the two variants never send both.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int64"
            }
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/PageSize"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/PageAfter"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "One page of users.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UsersResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "operationId": "createUser",
        "tags": [
          "users"
        ],
        "summary": "Create a user",
        "externalDocs": {
          "url": "https://developer.zendesk.com/api-reference/ticketing/users/users/#create-user"
        },
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "user"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "user": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Created user.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "user": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
